  "description": "Installation and display of a number of signs comprising: i)  A new fascia with trough lighting running the width of the frontage over a centrally located 'KFC' sign in powder coated aluminium coloured white with black returns; ii) A replacement acrylic projecting sign with external illumination in place of the existing projecting sign at the righthand side of the unit; iii) An aluminium panel above the customer entrance containing a back lit stained glass effect KFC bucket logo; iv) Existing shopfront to be deep cleaned and repainted to match existing colour scheme; v) Replacement of existing double door entrance with single door solution to enhance accessible access; vi) Installation of new transom on left hand window to match detail on right hand side.",
